#### 2.2 Rate Limiting

**Problem**: Zero rate limiting anywhere. Auth endpoints, billing endpoints, and webhook endpoints are all vulnerable to brute force and abuse.

##### [MODIFY] [promptline-api/index.js](file:///e:/promptline-new/promptline-api/index.js)
Add `@fastify/rate-limit`:
```javascript
await fastify.register(import('@fastify/rate-limit'), {
  max: 100,        // 100 req/min per IP globally
  timeWindow: '1 minute',
});
// Override on webhook routes: higher limit for Twilio bursts
// Override on sensitive routes: lower limit
```

##### [NEW] `promptline-secure/api/_middleware.ts` (Vercel Edge Middleware)
##### [NEW] `promptline-admin/api/_middleware.ts`
Rate limit auth-related routes at the Vercel edge:
- Login attempts: 10/min per IP
- Signup: 5/min per IP
- Password reset: 3/min per IP

