#### 2.3 Secure Session Handling

**Problem**: The Secure app's [AuthProvider](file:///e:/promptline-new/promptline-secure/src/auth/AuthProvider.tsx#L94-L108) caches `roles` and `currentTenantId` in `localStorage`. While RLS protects server-side, a tampered role array could show/hide UI elements incorrectly (information disclosure).

##### [MODIFY] [AuthProvider.tsx](file:///e:/promptline-new/promptline-secure/src/auth/AuthProvider.tsx) (Secure)
- Remove `localStorage` caching of roles — always fetch fresh from `fetchCurrentUserRoles()` on session load
- Keep tenant ID in `sessionStorage` instead of `localStorage` (scoped to tab, cleared on close)
- Add idle timeout detection (optional, configurable)

##### [MODIFY] [AuthProvider.tsx](file:///e:/promptline-new/promptline-admin/src/auth/AuthProvider.tsx) (Admin)
- Add session idle timeout (30 min recommended for internal admin tool)
- Auto-redirect to login on timeout

